PING 192.168.1.145 (192.168.1.145): 56 data bytes  
64 bytes from 192.168.1.145: icmp\_seq=0 ttl=62 time=2.407 ms  
64 bytes from 192.168.1.145: icmp\_seq=1 ttl=62 time=8.484 ms  
